# BENTO — MASTER APPLICATION BUILD PROMPT
## Personal Finance, Daily Life & Productivity Operating System

**Project name:** BENTO  
**Tagline:** Your Life. One Place.  
**Platform:** Android (first priority)  
**Product philosophy:** Local-first · Offline-first · Private · Intelligent · Personal

