# 1. PRODUCT VISION

Build BENTO, a premium personal operating system that combines personal finance, daily planning, habits, goals, career, learning, health tracking and personal life management into one cohesive application.

BENTO is not simply a finance tracker, habit tracker, to-do list or notes application.

It is a unified system that helps users:
- Understand their financial position.
- Organize their daily life.
- Track habits and routines.
- Set and achieve personal goals.
- Monitor career and learning progress.
- Record important life events.
- Analyze their progress over time.
- Make better decisions using personal data.

Everything must work together.

**Core philosophy:**

"Capture anything. Organize everything. Understand your life."

The application must be genuinely usable without internet access. Do not make cloud services, accounts, subscriptions or external AI APIs prerequisites for core functionality.

